# Route: guide 43 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 59, 52
# quests, 2.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Stranglethorn Vale, Duskwood, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted
# Lands, Tanaris, Thousand Needles, Tirisfal Glades): The Crossroads -> Camp
# Taurajo -> The Merchant Coast -> Camp Taurajo -> The Crossroads -> Honor's
# Stand -> Boulder Lode Mine -> The Mor'shan Rampart -> The Merchant Coast ->
# Ratchet -> The Mor'shan Rampart -> The Crossroads -> Ratchet -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells
# (2865), Troll Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle
# (3447), The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final
# Tablets (4788), Gahz'rilla (2770), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family
# Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael
# (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

